{"synopsis":"Ravis Vindica, putra dari Raja Iblis Agung yang menguasai Dunia Iblis.\nKarena bertindak sewenang-wenang dan memusnahkan satu keluarga iblis yang memberontak, ia dijatuhi hukuman berupa pengasingan ke Dunia Manusia.\n\nSaat menjalani kehidupan dalam tubuh seorang siswa biasa, ia menyadari bahwa kekuatan sihir iblis yang seharusnya tidak bisa ia gunakan ternyata bereaksi terhadap “kejahatan”.\n\nSedikit demi sedikit ia mulai memahami cara menggunakan kekuatannya, dan ia pun memulai pencarian petunjuk untuk kembali ke Dunia Iblis.","alternative_title":"마왕18세","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"014a816d-5bdb-4fcd-897b-fdcd8475f387","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"fe9446af-93eb-4d63-af4e-d10a83e31d6d","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"11cd0f18-1ded-49c7-97cb-2a668750dbd4","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"27b0a1cd-71ca-48f6-a672-7e036d031017","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"e34bdc7c-f8e4-4d0c-8341-ae86f9d677a5","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"752666f6-1a7d-4de0-84da-21ad57dc576c","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"6c39ee8f-576d-4080-9bcb-8acc4357c3dc","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"e019206c-aea7-4cab-a94c-4b1c7d5803b4","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"edafead1-656f-4aaf-8b77-d4498346f259","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"cfd8dc14-3f66-47cc-ad1d-4effec1e3a1d","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"0e10f8f8-0890-4abc-9db6-575846566878","date":"2026-05-13","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"37795083-87e1-438a-9003-f28803d0514c","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"b060cf90-e4f1-4a3d-9b6a-0